      "writtenOn": "2020-11-09T12:36:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thinking some more, if this iterator generates the level offset and the offset of the hash at that level down the tree from the root, you can try_fold(), verifying the level and passing on the expected hash of the next level. If this ends Ok(chunk_hash), the tree is valid and you have the expected hash for the chunk, otherwise it\u0027ll exit early with Err(_). That removes all need for collecting.",
      "parentUuid": "10846e7e_dffe1de5",
